{"time": 1772522536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2000247748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=667FA6FC1915FEF7AF939E806ED00929.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRoXCa-alei3NWTqheTCKREeLBaOBiWuiIg_woo06fMgJmDkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQrwPKRKIR3k7QzwiYT6lJCHoCCs-CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMA2oGzR4kZkvUqIIwr7BwqqQcUXHBn5AWzrv3cwED8XSrpWk-lmryZtHK9Zg1LKiFw,file_size=564502]"}
{"time": 1772522554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245631515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（🍬完了（））"}
{"time": 1772522626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529029035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在黑色的缝隙里，你的视野似乎一瞬间拉得极深，像灵魂都飘在了身后，用第三人称视角观测接下来将会发生的事。\n你看见头顶正上方那空调外机护栏上的几颗螺丝激烈地颤动，而后弹出。那护栏直直地掉了下来，正对着你的头。\n但在目眩神迷般拉回身体内的下一秒，它像泡沫般的幻觉，只是一瞬间就偏离你看见的轨迹而去。"}
