{"time": 1772522954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312482193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一声非人的尖啸穿过了你的耳膜。"}
