{"time": 1772523789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840021689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那家伙，邪教徒，还是什么非人生物，在你因那声尖啸而下意识偏过目光的一瞬间消失。只留下了那件斗篷和几滴黑色的不明液体。"}
{"time": 1772524007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571576711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“啧，怎么消失的？”"}
{"time": 1772524036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871705819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "环视一下，不太相信就这么从眼皮底子下不见了"}
{"time": 1772524087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772372673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "就好像什么也没发生过，如果不是眼前还有这件斗篷的话..."}
{"time": 1772524091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553067934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "找不到就只能收好这斗篷，用证物袋装一下液体"}
{"time": 1772524176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970126411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你抖了抖斗篷，发现上面沾着些古怪的黑色物质，像是某种液体黏在上面，干涸皲裂后又剥落。你注意到这件斗篷上有暗纹图样，或许与它的信仰有关"}
{"time": 1772524288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766109307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你怎么取样呢（）"}
