{"time": 1772524720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96283382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（警员只有一个（））"}
{"time": 1772524725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923957616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（鉴识科的不算警员）"}
{"time": 1772524744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397062515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "鉴识科的人来得很快，他们取了一些残留的液体样本准备进行实验，而负责收集的警员看着手中的样本，表情却逐渐凝重了起来"}
{"time": 1772524747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "957343168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好吧，其实算）"}
{"time": 1772524760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881285232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你的电话突然响起了"}
{"time": 1772524814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789977686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（怎么会不算（）"}
{"time": 1772524895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160774895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "接电话"}
{"time": 1772524928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91801071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "是局长的电话"}
{"time": 1772524945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365828749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真中啊”你听见她的声音也是有些疲惫的，“这次的侦查结果如何，是否与邪教徒事件有关？”"}
{"time": 1772524948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "739066984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（改下你id）"}
{"time": 1772525076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2076552766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“八九不离十吧，我找到一个戴着乌鸦面具的神秘人，他可以在墙上移动，诡异得很，本来想抓起来问话的，被他跑了”"}
{"time": 1772525113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520409864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“只留下一件斗篷和一些奇怪的腐蚀性液体，鉴识课的人已经在忙了”"}
{"time": 1772525160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090538402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "单手拿手机，另一只手掏出烟和火机点燃，长吸一口气又缓慢吐出"}
{"time": 1772525220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539259725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我说这还真挺邪门的，我刚才也好像看到了幻觉”"}
{"time": 1772525231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117352922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊，不过这次打电话是想告诉你，今天早些时候出了一起新的自杀事故，希望你可以去医院寻找浅上真有理医生了解一下情况。”你简单进行汇报后，听见她下达了这样的指令，“虽然听上去有些强人所难，但目前是特殊时期，希望你可以坚持一下。”"}
{"time": 1772525268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940172440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=397062515]（实际并不会在现场实验吧也许）"}
{"time": 1772525271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656765841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=539259725][CQ:at,qq=2468514664] 听到你说这话，她沉默了一下“如果你太累的话，找完医生之后可以请假休息一下...”"}
{"time": 1772525284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579236828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1940172440]（拿回去鉴定啊）"}
{"time": 1772525331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856093927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（那脸色凝重啥（）"}
