{"time": 1772525432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1483563782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“没事，问题不大”再长吸一口，在地上捻灭剩下的一小段烟头，随手丢进垃圾桶"}
{"time": 1772525530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321256486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“拜托你了...”随后局长便挂了电话"}
{"time": 1772525546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419238505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1035799209", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后你注意到你们的四人小群，有两个人聊了半天"}
